{"content":[{"c":["LIBNI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Gershon’s son, the grandson of Levi, and Shimei’s brother (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.17","r":"Exod.6.17","rawR":"Exod.6.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.17","value":"Exod.6.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.3.18","r":"Num.3.18","rawR":"Num.3.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.3.18","value":"Num.3.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 3:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.17,20","r":"1Chr.6.17,20","rawR":"1Chr.6.17,20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.17,20","value":"1Chr.6.17,20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:17, 20"},"). He was the father of three sons and the founder of the Libnite family (",{"href":"?bref=Num.3.21","r":"Num.3.21","rawR":"Num.3.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.3.21","value":"Num.3.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 3:21"},"). Libni is alternately called Ladan in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.7-9","r":"1Chr.23.7-9","rawR":"1Chr.23.7-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.7-9","value":"1Chr.23.7-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 23:7-9"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.21","r":"1Chr.26.21","rawR":"1Chr.26.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.21","value":"1Chr.26.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"26:21"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Mahli’s son, the father of Shimei, and a descendant of Levi through Merari’s line (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.29","r":"1Chr.6.29","rawR":"1Chr.6.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.29","value":"1Chr.6.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Libni","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 6:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.6.17","rawQueryValue":"Exod.6.17","sourceRefExact":"Exod.6.17"},{"anchorText":"Nm 3:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.3.18","rawQueryValue":"Num.3.18","sourceRefExact":"Num.3.18"},{"anch